**
** PART DEFINITION
** =================================================================
*NODE
** Nodes for 2D rectangular domain (10m x 2m)
** Refined mesh with ~240 elements in x-direction, 48 in y-direction
** Node numbering: 1 to 11809 (241 x 49 grid)
    1,  0.000000,  0.000000
    2,  0.041667,  0.000000
    3,  0.083333,  0.000000
    4,  0.125000,  0.000000
    5,  0.166667,  0.000000
** ... (abbreviated for brevity - full mesh would have 11809 nodes)
** Last nodes
11808,  9.958333,  2.000000
11809, 10.000000,  2.000000
**
*ELEMENT, TYPE=AC2D4
** 4-node acoustic elements for 2D analysis
** Total elements: 11520 (240 x 48)
    1,     1,     2,    51,    50
    2,     2,     3,    52,    51
    3,     3,     4,    53,    52
** ... (abbreviated - full mesh would have 11520 elements)
11520, 11759, 11760, 11809, 11808
