** SECTION ASSIGNMENTS
** =================================================================
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=LAYER1, MATERIAL=WATER_WARM
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=LAYER2, MATERIAL=WATER_TRANSITION
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=LAYER3, MATERIAL=WATER_COLD
